DESCRIPTION:Address of the Homecoming Centre: 15 Buitenkant Street (corner Buitenkant & Caledon)\, District Six\, Cape Town\nMap: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Homecoming+Centre+15+Buitenkant+Street+Cape+Town\n\nAgenda for the evening:\n18h45 - Arrive in the foyer of the Homecoming Centre\, and proceed (follow ushers and signs) to the rooftop\n19h00 - 20h00: Satsang on the rooftop\n20h00 - 20h15: Intermission\, then proceed to the Star Theatre (please be seated on time for the welcome\, introduction\, short video and curtain rise)\n20h15 - 21h30: Show: THE POWER WE HOLD\n\nEnjoy the celebration with us.
